      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Indian National Congress sessions served as major strategic milestones in the Indian national movement.",
        "The administration of Governor-Generals of India spanned from 1773 to 1858 under East India Company rule.",
        "The direct control of the British Crown began with the Viceroys of India, covering the period from 1858 to 1947.",
        "Understanding key INC sessions and viceregal tenures is vital for answering direct questions in SSC exams."
